SUMMARY:🪦 MAI-Code-1-Flash (GitHub Copilot) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Announced August 21\, gone from Copilot September 10 — twen
 ty days' notice for a model that was itself the named replacement for Ra
 ptor mini. The only Copilot retirement on the calendar after September 8
 . Replacement: MAI-Code-1.1-Flash. Source: https://docs.github.com/en/co
 pilot/reference/ai-models/supported-models
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#mai-code-1-flash-github-copilot
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
