DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260914
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260915
SUMMARY:🪦 Amazon Nova Gen-1 (Premier\, Sonic\, Canvas\, Reel) shuts do
 wn
DESCRIPTION:Amazon's first-generation Nova line is being cleared off Bedr
 ock: Premier and Sonic on September 14\, Canvas and Reel on September 30
 . Nova launched at re:Invent in December 2024 as Amazon's answer to fron
 tier models\; the second generation replaces it inside two years. Replac
 ement: Nova 2 Sonic / Nova 2 Lite\; Luma Ray v2 for video. Source: https
 ://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/model-lifecycle.html
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#amazon-nova-gen-1-premier-sonic-c
 anvas-reel
