DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260915
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260916
SUMMARY:🪦 MAI-Transcribe-1 (Microsoft Foundry) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Version 2026-01-23\, retired September 15\, 2026 — less tha
 n eight months old. Microsoft's first-party speech model line is now on 
 the same accelerated churn as its image models. Replacement: MAI-Transcr
 ibe-1.5. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/
 concepts/model-retirement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#mai-transcribe-1-microsoft-foundr
 y
