BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sora-api@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260924
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260925
SUMMARY:🪦 Sora API shuts down
DESCRIPTION:While the Sora app died in April\, the API endpoint survives 
 until September. Then it's gone completely. Replacement: None (ChatGPT i
 mage gen only). Source: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001152-wha
 t-to-know-about-the-sora-discontinuation
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#sora-api
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-davinci-002-babbage-002-gpt-3-5-turbo-instruct@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260928
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260929
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI davinci-002\, babbage-002 & gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct sh
 uts down
DESCRIPTION:The end of the GPT-3 base-model lineage. These three shipped 
 in August 2023\, inherited the job when the original ada/babbage/curie/d
 avinci died in January 2024\, and are the last models served over the le
 gacy /v1/completions endpoint. Their own fine-tuned versions outlive the
 m by 25 days. Replacement: gpt-5.6-terra. Source: https://developers.ope
 nai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-davinci-002-babbage-002-gp
 t-3-5-turbo-instruct
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mistral-leanstral-1-5@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:🪦 Mistral Leanstral 1.5 shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Mistral announced this Lean 4 formal-proof model's death in t
 he same sentence that announced its birth. The changelog reads: 'We rele
 ased Leanstral 1.5... This model will be retired on September 30\, 2026.
 ' A 92-day advertised lifespan\, dead on arrival by design. Replacement:
  None named. Source: https://github.com/mistralai/platform-docs-public
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#mistral-leanstral-1-5
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:amazon-mechanical-turk@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:🪦 Amazon Mechanical Turk shuts down
DESCRIPTION:The 21-year-old marketplace Jeff Bezos once called "artificia
 l artificial intelligence" — the humans who labelled a generation of t
 raining data — closes on September 30\, 2026. New customers were cut o
 ff July 30. Amazon cites "an internal assessment of its programs and ser
 vices"\; everyone else notes that the models MTurk workers trained now d
 o MTurk's job. Replacement: None — Scale AI\, Mercor and Prolific abso
 rbed the market. Source: https://www.cnbc.com/2026/08/25/amazon-service-
 that-jeff-bezos-called-artificial-ai-is-shutting-down.html
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#amazon-mechanical-turk
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gemini-omni-flash-preview@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:🪦 Gemini Omni Flash Preview shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Google's text-and-image-to-video model shipped June 30\, 2026
  and was deprecated on August 27\, the day gemini-omni-1.1-flash went GA
 . Shutdown September 30 — a 92-day life\, with the successor announced
  and the death date set in the same changelog entry. Replacement: gemini
 -omni-1.1-flash. Source: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/changelog
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gemini-omni-flash-preview
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:google-gemini-2-5-flash-image-nano-banana@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261003
SUMMARY:🪦 Google Gemini 2.5 Flash Image ("Nano Banana") shuts down
DESCRIPTION:The image model that went viral as 'Nano Banana' and briefly 
 made Gemini the #1 free iPhone app shuts down exactly one year after rel
 ease\, to the day. Google's officially recommended replacement\, gemini-
 3.1-flash-image-preview\, was itself shut down in June 2026. The migrati
 on target is dead\; the model isn't yet. Replacement: gemini-3.1-flash-i
 mage-preview (already retired). Source: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api
 /docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#google-gemini-2-5-flash-image-nan
 o-banana
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
