DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
SUMMARY:🪦 Azure OpenAI GPT-4.1\, 4.1 mini & 4.1 nano shuts down
DESCRIPTION:GPT-4.1 launched April 2025 as OpenAI's 'best model for codin
 g' with a 1M-token context window. Azure retires it\, plus mini and nano
 \, after 18 months. Fine-tuned deployments on the same bases get a one-y
 ear stay of execution. Replacement: gpt-5 / gpt-5-mini / gpt-5-nano. Sou
 rce: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/concepts/
 model-retirements
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#azure-openai-gpt-4-1-4-1-mini-4-1
 -nano
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sora-2-on-azure-openai-foundry@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261015
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261016
SUMMARY:🪦 Sora 2 on Azure OpenAI / Foundry shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Sora outlives its maker's own shutdown by three weeks: Micros
 oft pushed the Azure retirement from September 15 to October 15\, with n
 o replacement. OpenAI's own Sora API dies September 24. The last place t
 o generate a Sora video will be a Microsoft data centre. Replacement: No
 ne listed. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/opena
 i/concepts/model-retirement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#sora-2-on-azure-openai-foundry
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
