DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261016
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261017
SUMMARY:🪦 Gemini 2.5 Pro / Flash / Flash Lite (Vertex AI) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Google's entire Gemini 2.5 family retires on Vertex AI no ear
 lier than October 16\, 2026. Note this is Vertex-only — the Gemini Dev
 eloper API still lists no shutdown date for the same three models. Repla
 cement: Gemini 3.x series. Source: https://docs.cloud.google.com/vertex-
 ai/generative-ai/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gemini-2-5-pro-flash-flash-lite-v
 ertex-ai
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:azure-openai-o-series-o1-o3-o4-mini-o3-pro@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:🪦 Azure OpenAI o-series (o1\, o3\, o4-mini\, o3-pro) shuts dow
 n
DESCRIPTION:Azure deletes an entire generation of reasoning models in und
 er 90 days: o3-mini October 1\, o4-mini October 16\, o1/o1-pro/o3 Octobe
 r 21\, codex-mini November 15\, o3-pro December 17. Four have no named r
 eplacement — Microsoft declares one only 90 to 120 days out\, because 
 'declaring a replacement too early risks directing customers to a model 
 that is no longer the best available option.' Replacement: gpt-5.6-sol (
 partial)\; several unnamed. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/az
 ure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-retirement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#azure-openai-o-series-o1-o3-o4-mi
 ni-o3-pro
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:vertex-ai-open-model-maas-13-models@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:🪦 Vertex AI Open-Model MaaS (13 models) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Google Cloud drops managed serving for 13 open models on Octo
 ber 21 — DeepSeek V3.1\, GLM-5 and 4.7\, gpt-oss-20b\, Kimi K2 Thinkin
 g\, Llama 3.3 70B\, MiniMax M2\, two e5 embedding models and four Qwen3 
 variants. You can still run them\; you just have to host them yourself. 
 Replacement: Self-deploy the weights from Model Garden. Source: https://
 docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/deprecatio
 ns/open-models
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#vertex-ai-open-model-maas-13-mode
 ls
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-fine-tuning-new-orgs@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI Fine-tuning (new orgs) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:New organizations can no longer create fine-tuning jobs. The 
 first wave executed on schedule July 23\, 2026\; the second takes every 
 remaining fine-tuned model — ft-gpt-3.5-turbo\, ft-gpt-4\, ft-gpt-4.1-
 nano\, ft-babbage-002 and ft-davinci-002 — on October 23. Replacement:
  Prompt caching / system prompts. Source: https://developers.openai.com/
 api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-fine-tuning-new-orgs
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-gpt-4-gpt-4-turbo-gpt-3-5-turbo-the-o-series@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI GPT-4\, GPT-4 Turbo\, GPT-3.5 Turbo & the o-series sh
 uts down
DESCRIPTION:One date kills three eras. On October 23\, OpenAI removes gpt
 -3.5-turbo (the engine that launched ChatGPT)\, gpt-4 and gpt-4-0613 (th
 e model that defined 2023)\, and its entire first generation of reasonin
 g models — o1\, o1-pro\, o3-mini\, o4-mini — plus gpt-4o-2024-05-13 
 and gpt-image-1. Every fine-tune built on them dies the same day. Sevent
 een table rows\, six months' notice. Replacement: gpt-5.5 / gpt-5.4-mini
  / gpt-5.4-nano / gpt-image-2. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api
 /docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-gpt-4-gpt-4-turbo-gpt-3-5-
 turbo-the-o-series
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:vertex-ai-extensions@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:🪦 Vertex AI Extensions shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Google's managed tool-calling framework for Gemini\, deprecat
 ed with the standard six-month window and switched off after November 26
 \, 2026. The replacement is the Agent Platform — the third name for th
 is idea in as many years. Replacement: Agent Platform. Source: https://d
 ocs.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#vertex-ai-extensions
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-legacy-gpt-image-models@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI Legacy GPT Image Models shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Older GPT Image model snapshots were flagged for removal from
  the API on December 1\, 2026\, just months after they replaced DALL·E.
  The endpoint that buried DALL·E is already on its own deprecation cloc
 k. Replacement: GPT Image 1.5. Source: https://platform.openai.com/docs/
 deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-legacy-gpt-image-models
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-gpt-5-original-snapshots-o3-o3-pro@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI GPT-5 (original snapshots)\, o3 & o3-pro shuts down
DESCRIPTION:The original GPT-5 launch snapshots — gpt-5-2025-08-07 and 
 its mini\, nano and pro siblings — plus o3 and o3-pro shut down Decemb
 er 11. GPT-5 launched in August 2025 as the 'PhD-level expert' model. It
 s launch snapshot gets 16 months before it starts returning errors. Repl
 acement: gpt-5.6-sol / gpt-5.6-terra / gpt-5.6-luna. Source: https://dev
 elopers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-gpt-5-original-snapshots-o
 3-o3-pro
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-realtime-audio-model-family@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270121
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI Realtime & Audio Model Family shuts down
DESCRIPTION:OpenAI put its entire GA voice stack on death row: gpt-realti
 me\, gpt-audio\, gpt-realtime-mini\, gpt-audio-mini and all four gpt-4o 
 audio/realtime variants. gpt-realtime and gpt-audio went GA in August 20
 25 — the models that headlined 'production-ready voice agents' get rou
 ghly 17 months. OpenAI is skipping its own intermediate generation: the 
 1.5 series shipped in February 2026 and the named replacement is already
  2.1. Replacement: gpt-realtime-2.1 / gpt-realtime-2.1-mini / gpt-audio-
 1.5. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-realtime-audio-model-famil
 y
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-whisper-1-gpt-4o-transcribe@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T062926Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270226
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270227
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI Whisper-1 & GPT-4o Transcribe shuts down
DESCRIPTION:On August 26 OpenAI deprecated whisper-1 — its original spe
 ech-to-text API from March 2023 — together with gpt-4o-transcribe\, gp
 t-4o-mini-transcribe and gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize\, the last of which s
 hipped in October 2025. All four die February 26\, 2027. The open-source
  Whisper weights are unaffected\; the hosted endpoint that made them a p
 roduct is not. Replacement: gpt-transcribe / gpt-live-transcribe. Source
 : https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations#2026-08-26-transcr
 iption-models
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-whisper-1-gpt-4o-transcrib
 e
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
